PUT /twitter-index          -> index oluştur
GET /twitter-index          -> index bilgisi getir
DELETE /twitter-index       -> index sil
POST /twitter-index/_search -> arama yap




PUT http://localhost:9200/twitter-index


Content-Type: application/json
{
  "mappings": {
    "properties": {
      "userId": {
        "type": "long"
      },
      "id": {
        "type": "text",
        "fields": {
          "keyword": {
            "type": "keyword",
            "ignore_above": 256
          }
        }
      },
      "createdAt": {
        "type": "date",
        "format": "yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ssZZ"
      },
      "text": {
        "type": "text",
        "fields": {
          "keyword": {
            "type": "keyword",
            "ignore_above": 256
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}